Package: vabaxos-camera
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, python3-pil, tesseract-ocr, tesseract-ocr-ita, tesseract-ocr-eng, vabaxos-ocr
Recommends: vabaxos-describe
Description: Read with the camera, guided by the voice
 Hold a letter, a bill or a label in front of the webcam: about every
 second the voice says what to do (more light, nearer, farther, a little
 to the left or to the right, said as the user sees it). When the text is
 all in the picture it takes the picture by itself and opens the text in
 the window of the screen reader's text recognition. Describe sends the
 picture to the description of pictures, without Internet.
